WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.642 --> 00:00:02.798
- So where do you see
yourself in five years?

00:00:02.798 --> 00:00:05.932
- Honestly, I'd love to
be married with a baby.

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:08.658
Yeah, I mean, figure out
a way to work from home,

00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:11.557
and maybe just come into
the office as needed.

00:00:11.557 --> 00:00:13.299
(coughing)

00:00:13.299 --> 00:00:14.368
- Sounds great.

00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:15.644
(laughs uncomfortably)

00:00:16.271 --> 00:00:18.012
(energetic music)

00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:21.891
- Aww, Allison, you look cute today!

00:00:21.891 --> 00:00:23.116
- Thank you!

00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:24.507
I think so too.

00:00:26.397 --> 00:00:28.245
- Oh, okay.

00:00:29.857 --> 00:00:31.888
- Just wanna let you know I
got your email, it looks--

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:33.137
Oh what's wrong?

00:00:33.137 --> 00:00:35.320
- Oh, Henry just yelled at me in a meeting

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.783
for something I didn't even do,

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:39.694
so, I like, powercried in
the bathroom for 10 minutes,

00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:41.231
but now I'm fine.

00:00:42.163 --> 00:00:44.007
- Sorry, um...

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:46.460
Toughen up, kid.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.530
(laughter)

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.755
- Allison, what's wrong,
why aren't you laughing?

00:00:51.771 --> 00:00:54.254
- Oh, it just wasn't very funny.

00:00:55.732 --> 00:00:57.648
- Someone needs to bake
herself a sense of humor.

00:00:57.648 --> 00:01:00.481
(laughter)

00:01:00.481 --> 00:01:04.113
- Hey, uh, would you wanna
get dinner Friday, my treat?

00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:05.884
- Oh, like a big group thing?

00:01:05.884 --> 00:01:07.324
Like a hangout?

00:01:07.324 --> 00:01:09.548
- No, just a date.

00:01:09.548 --> 00:01:12.107
- Oh, oh...

00:01:12.818 --> 00:01:15.704
I would, but, I've got this um...

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:19.503
- Okay, no pressure.

00:01:19.503 --> 00:01:20.952
- We will definitely be together because

00:01:20.952 --> 00:01:22.826
he will leave his girlfriend
and we'll be soulmates--

00:01:22.826 --> 00:01:24.787
- Gabby, I'm sorry, but you
talk to me about this guy

00:01:24.787 --> 00:01:27.295
everyday, you never listen
to any of my advice.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.743
I'm sorry, I can't hear it anymore.

00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:30.169
It's not healthy.

00:01:31.197 --> 00:01:32.994
- I mean, we can just go
see the movie next week.

00:01:32.994 --> 00:01:35.907
- Yeah, oh, I gotta go change my tampon.

00:01:35.907 --> 00:01:37.229
Be right back.

00:01:38.844 --> 00:01:40.168
- Well that was really fun.

00:01:40.168 --> 00:01:41.398
- Yeah, I'll see you later.

00:01:41.398 --> 00:01:43.595
- I guess I should walk you to your car?

00:01:43.595 --> 00:01:45.554
- No, I don't need you
to walk me to my car.

00:01:45.554 --> 00:01:46.623
I'm fine, it's right here.

00:01:46.623 --> 00:01:47.872
- But it's not safe.

00:01:47.872 --> 00:01:48.963
- It's ok, it's right here.

00:01:48.963 --> 00:01:50.194
- But I...

00:01:50.194 --> 00:01:51.099
- Chris I'm okay.

00:01:51.099 --> 00:01:53.191
- But I, uh--

00:01:53.191 --> 00:01:55.076
- Chris, it's literally right here.

00:01:55.076 --> 00:01:57.826
- See, I should, I feel like I need to...

00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:59.788
- You wanna supervise me getting in?

00:02:00.951 --> 00:02:02.422
- I love you?

